**Vulnerability Type:** Access control issues
**Severity:** Medium
**Affected Code Location:** `Init` function (line 17)
**Description:** The `Init` function uses `cid.AssertAttributeValue` to check if the attribute `abac.init` is set to `true`. However, this check is not sufficient to ensure that only authorized users can invoke the `Init` function. Any user can invoke the `Init` function if they know the function name and parameters.

**Recommended Fix:** Implement proper access control checks to ensure that only authorized users can invoke the `Init` function. This can be done by checking the identity of the invoking user and verifying their permissions.

